OL,3,GNEWSABullying claim against deputy
OL,4,Afirst minister Gilruth is 'baseless' -
OL,5,ASwinney
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister John Swinney has
OL,8,Fdismissed an accusation of bullying
OL,9,Fagainst his deputy Jenny Gilruth as
OL,10,F"baseless".
OL,12,FThe Scottish Sun on Sunday reported
OL,13,Fthat Gilruth wrote an email naming
OL,14,Fofficials in her department that she
OL,15,Fwanted to axe, which was accidentally
OL,16,Fsent to them.
OL,18,FAn insider told the newspaper that
OL,19,Fstaff were "terrified" of the deputy
OL,20,Ffirst minister because she is a
OL,21,F"bully".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
