OL,3,GNEWSABullying claim against deputy
OL,4,Afirst minister Gilruth is 'baseless' -
OL,5,ASwinney
OL,6,
OL,7,FSwinney said there was "no basis" to
OL,8,Fthe accusations and that "there was no
OL,9,Femail issued by deputy first minister
OL,10,For her office".
